; WHO 1 Lighting: Area-0 point-to-point addressing (A=00, PL=01..15)
; Stimulates gateways with 4-digit A=00 point addresses (assigned by Home + Project),
; 2-digit zero-padded addresses, single-digit addresses, area 0 broadcast,
; and local bus routing (#4#01).
; Addresses OpenWebNet-HA/own-firmware-oracle#35 and OpenWebNet-HA/MyHOME#684.

; 1. 4-digit point-to-point addressing (A=00, PL=1, 2, 10, 15)
down *1*1*0001##
down *1*0*0001##
down *#1*0001##
down *1*1*0002##
down *1*0*0002##
down *#1*0002##
down *1*1*0010##
down *1*0*0010##
down *#1*0010##
down *1*1*0015##
down *1*0*0015##
down *#1*0015##

; 2. 2-digit zero-padded addressing (PL=2)
down *1*1*02##
down *1*0*02##
down *#1*02##

; 3. Single-digit addressing (WHERE=2: area 2 command vs point 2)
down *1*1*2##
down *1*0*2##
down *#1*2##

; 4. Area 0 broadcast vs General broadcast
down *1*1*00##
down *#1*00##
down *1*1*0##
down *#1*0##

; 5. Local bus routing (#4#01)
down *1*1*0002#4#01##
down *#1*0002#4#01##
down *1*1*0010#4#01##
down *#1*0010#4#01##
down *1*1*02#4#01##
down *1*1*2#4#01##
